  ('00000000-0004-4000-8000-000000000001', 'How to vet a wholesale activewear supplier: an 8-point checklist', 'how-to-vet-a-wholesale-activewear-supplier', 'Buyer checklist · Supplier evaluation', 'A practical checklist of the evidence that matters, from sample quality to written terms and shipping records.', 'https://gizqprknpnmdcfaapurm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/crown_performance_bucket/site/post-vet-2a35c71c4f.webp', 'A practical checklist of the evidence that matters, from sample quality to written terms and shipping records.

## Start with the brief

Before comparing suppliers, write down your product, quantity, target price and delivery date. A clear brief makes every quotation comparable.

